;; A Java program from sources by two modules reading its class path (GH4 (iii) of the Ghidra case study's G1
;; plan; J2G-SPEC §10.3, "The class path's entries by name"; bin/arbace-go --build-program): java.class.path
;; lists the modules' resource directories by name in the plan's order (bin/java-project's
;; resources.jars/NNN-MODULE: 001-core:002-plugin), and a URLClassLoader over each entry's name finds the
;; resources that entry has. There is no JDK run of it (the names are no directories there).
{:main-class cp.plugin.Main
 :java {:release 25
        :modules [{:name "core" :src ["core/src"] :resources ["core/res"]}
                  {:name "plugin" :src ["plugin/src"] :resources ["plugin/res"] :deps ["core"]}]}}
